  <office:body>
    <office:text>
      <text:p text:style-name="P">[유치부 · 초등 저학년부] 서식 1</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전 참가신청서</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="신청서1" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>접수번호</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 신청은 작성하지 마세요</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">팀명</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>참가 학생</text:p><text:p>출생년도</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">참가 자격</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>□ 서초구 거주</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>대표자</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>□ 서초구 소재 어린이집·유치원·초등학교 재원·재학</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">대표자</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">성명</table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">휴대폰</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>연락가능한</text:p><text:p>가족(보호자)</text:p><text:p>중 1인</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">주소</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">이메일</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="5"><text:p>팀원</text:p><text:p>정보</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">성명</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">휴대폰 번호</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">이메일주소</table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">없을 경우 미기재</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">없을 경우 미기재</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2"><text:p>만화내용</text:p><text:p>요약문</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">만화 제목</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">스토리텔링</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">※ 만화 줄거리, 만화소개 등 설명 자유 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2">활용 AI 툴</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">활용 AI 이름</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">사용한 명령어<br/>(프롬프트)</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">※ 입력했던 명령어 요약 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2">준수사항 동의</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>본인은 ‘2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전’의 유의사항과 준수사항 등 제반규정을 숙지하였으며, 이를 준수하여 성실히 참가할 것에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">동의함 □　 동의하지 않음 □</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Center">2026　년　　월　　일</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">신청인 (대표자) : 성명　　　　　(서명)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 공모전 참가신청서는 최대 2페이지를 넘지 않게 작성</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">- 1 -</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="Break"/>
      <text:p>[초등 고학년부 · 시니어부] 서식 1</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전 참가신청서</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="신청서2" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>접수번호</text:p><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 신청은 작성하지 마세요</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">참가 자격</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>□ 서초구 거주</text:p><text:p>□ 서초구 소재 초등학교 재학</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="3">참가자 정보</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">성명</table:table-cell><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">휴대폰</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2"/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">주소</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label">이메일</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2">만화내용 요약문</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">스토리 제목</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">스토리텔링</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">※ 만화 줄거리, 만화소개 등 설명 자유 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2">활용 AI 툴</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">활용 AI 이름</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">사용한 명령어 (프롬프트)</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="3"><text:p><text:span text:style-name="Gray">※ 입력했던 명령어 요약 기재 (1,000자 내외)</text:span></text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-rows-spanned="2">준수사항 동의</table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p>본인은 ‘2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전’의 유의사항과 준수사항 등 제반규정을 숙지하였으며, 이를 준수하여 성실히 참가할 것에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">동의함 □　 동의하지 않음 □</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="5"><text:p text:style-name="Center">2026　년　　월　　일</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">신청인　:　성명　　　　　(서명)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 공모전 참가신청서는 최대 2페이지를 넘지 않게 작성</text:span></text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">- 2 -</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="Break"/>
      <text:p>[공통] 서식 2</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Big">개인정보 수집 · 이용 동의서</text:p>
      <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 공모 신청자(대표자)가 팀원 전원의 개인정보 수집·이용 동의서를 각각 작성하여 제출</text:span></text:p>
      <table:table table:name="개인정보동의" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">성　 명</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">생년월일</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">주　 소</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">연락처<br/>(휴대전화번호)</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>□ 개인정보 수집·이용 내역</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">항목</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">수집·이용 목적</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">보유 및 이용기간</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2">성명, 생년월일, 주소, 연락처<br/>보호자(법정대리인)의 성명 및 연락처</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2">공모전 접수, 심사, 발표, 상장 수여</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="2">응모신청서 접수일로부터 <text:span text:style-name="Blue">1년</text:span></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>※ 개인정보의 수집·이용에 대한 동의를 거부할 수 있으며, 동의하지 않을 경우 심사 및 선정에서 제외됩니다.</text:p><text:p>☞ 위와 같이 개인정보를 수집·이용하는데 동의하십니까?　　동의　□　　미동의　□</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>□ 법정대리인 동의서　 <text:span text:style-name="Red">※ 개인정보 주체가 미성년자인 경우, 추가로 기재</text:span></text:p><text:p>본인은 미성년자의 법정대리인으로 위의 개인정보 수집·이용에 동의합니다.</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">법정대리인 성명</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"><text:p text:style-name="Center">(서명 또는 인)</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">법정대리인 연락처</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label" table:number-columns-spanned="2">대상자와의 관계</table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="4"/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p>상기 본인은 「개인정보보호법」 제15조 제1항(개인정보의 수집·이용)에 의거하여</text:p>
      <text:p>위와 같이 개인정보 수집 및 이용에 동의합니다.</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">2026년　　월　　일</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">성명 :　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Big">서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">- 3 -</text:p>

      <text:p text:style-name="Break"/>
      <text:p>[공통] 서식 3</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Big">2026 AI로 만드는 나만의 네컷만화 공모전</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Big">저작권 귀속 및 이용에 관한 동의서</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="저작권동의" table:style-name="T">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="C1"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C2"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C3"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C4"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C5"/><table:table-column table:style-name="C6"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:number-columns-spanned="6"><text:p>■ 제3자 저작권 등 관련</text:p><text:p>- 본인이 제출한 창작물은 타 공모전에 접수되지 않은 본인 순수저작물이며, 이미 발표되거나 모방 또는 차용하지 않았음을 확인합니다.</text:p><text:p>- 응모자는 창작물이 제3자의 저작권을 침해하지 않도록 주의의무를 다하여야 하며, 창작물에 사용한 이미지, 아이디어 등으로 제3자와 각종 지적재산권 및 기타 권리에 대한 분쟁이 발생되는 경우 이와 관련된 모든 민·형사상의 책임은 제안자 본인에게 있음을 확인합니다.</text:p><text:p>- 시상 이후에도 본인이 제출한 창작물이 부정한 방법에 의해 입상한 것으로 확인되는 경우에 입상결정은 무효이며, 지급받은 상장 부당이득을 반환할 것에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p>■ 저작권 귀속 및 저작물 이용</text:p><text:p>- 본 공모전 입상작은 별도의 권리 이전 절차 없이 지적재산권 일체 및 공표권, 원저작물을 각색, 변형할 수 있는 2차 저작물 작성권 등이 서초1동주민자치위원회에 귀속됩니다.</text:p><text:p>- 입상작은 공모전 종료 후 2차 저작물로 작성·복제·배포되어 향후 서초1동주민자치위원회 관련 SNS, 홍보물 제작 및 서울교육대학교 담장 갤러리 등 전시에 활용됩니다.</text:p><text:p>공모 신청자는 상기 내용에 대하여 거부할 권리가 있습니다. 단, 동의를 거부할 경우 본 공모전 심사 대상에서 제외될 수 있습니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">상기 내용에 동의합니다.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">□ 동의　　□ 동의하지 않음</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">2026　년　　월　　일</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">동의자 :　　　　　　　　　(서명 또는 인)</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Big">서초1동주민자치위원장 귀하</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/><table:covered-table-cell/></table:table-row>
      </table:table>
      <text:p text:style-name="Center">- 4 -</text:p>
    </office:text>
  </office:body>
</office:document>